d\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:#f97316\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg><span style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--text-color)\">NetProfit</span></a></div><button class=\"layout_mobileMenuBtn__fMkCt\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button><nav class=\"layout_nav__3Q3Pt \"><a class=\"layout_navLink__nNGYX\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><a class=\"layout_navLink__nNGYX\" href=\"/tools\">Tax Tools</a><a class=\"layout_navLink__nNGYX\" href=\"/news\">Blogs</a><a class=\"layout_navLink__nNGYX\" href=\"/ipo\">IPOs</a></nav></header><main class=\"layout_mainContent__LZaIE\"><div class=\"page_container__aoG4z\"><section class=\"page_hero__SKW6o\"><div class=\"page_heroContent__2lPR8\"><h1 class=\"page_title__3jonF\">One Platform for All Your Tax, Legal &amp; Business Registration Needs</h1><p class=\"page_subtitle__iAJUg\">File ITR, register your company and manage GST compliance with expert CAs at NetProfit. Trusted by 12,000+ founders across India.</p><div class=\"page_ctaGroup__4nfzF\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary page_heroBtn__r_PtW\" href=\"/auth?mode=register\">Registration</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary page_heroBtn__r_PtW\" href=\"/auth?mode=login\">Login</a></div><div class=\"page_trustBadges__Ch2Ce\"><span>🔒 100% Secure Platform</span><span>• Verified Experts</span><span>• Pan-India Service</span></div></div></section><section class=\"page_section__61PEw\"><h2 class=\"page_sectionTitle__hzsAh\">Our Core Services</h2><div class=\"page_features__8wy9y\"><div class=\"premium-card page_featureCard__09F8a\"><div class=\"page_featureIcon__mHZON\">🏢</div><h2>Corporate Services</h2><p>Complete corporate solutions from company registration to annual compliance. Start your business the right way.</p><a class=\"page_learnMore__EJ0mi\" href=\"/services/private-limited-company\">Read More →</a></div><div class=\"premium-card page_featureCard__09F8a\"><div class=\"page_featureIcon__mHZON\">⚖️</div><h2>Legal Services</h2><p>Our experts oversee contracts, disputes, and legal problems. Stay fully compliant and secure.</p><a class=\"page_learnMore__EJ0mi\" href=\"/services\">Read More →</a></div><div class=\"premium-card page_featureCard__09F8a\"><div class=\"page_featureIcon__mHZON\">📜</div><h2>Licensing Services</h2><p>Get essential business licenses seamlessly, from FSSAI to Trade Licenses and MSME registration.</p><a class=\"page_learnMore__EJ0mi\" href=\"/services\">Read More →</a></div><div class=\"premium-card page_featureCard__09F8a\"><div class=\"page_featureIcon__mHZON\">📊</div><h2>Accounting &amp; Taxation</h2><p>Manage finances and tax regulations easily. GST filing, ITR, and professional bookkeeping.</p><a class=\"page_learnMore__EJ0mi\" href=\"/services/gst-registration\">Read More →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"page_section__61PEw page_altSection__F_lvw\"><h2 class=\"page_sectionTitle__hzsAh\">Popular Services by NetProfit</h2><div class=\"page_servicesGrid__plSir\"><a class=\"premium-card page_serviceItem__VFzNf\" href=\"/services/private-limited-company\"><h3>Company Registration</h3><p>Pvt Ltd, LLP, Startups</p></a><a class=\"premium-card page_serviceItem__VFzNf\" href=\"/services/gst-registration\"><h3>GST Registration</h3><p>Fast &amp; 100% Online</p></a><a class=\"premium-card page_serviceItem__VFzNf\" href=\"/services/income-tax-return\"><h3>Income Tax Filing</h3><p>Max Refunds, Zero Errors</p></a><a class=\"premium-card page_serviceItem__VFzNf\" href=\"/services/limited-liability-partnership\"><h3>LLP Registration</h3><p>Register an LLP Fast</p></a><a class=\"premium-card page_serviceItem__VFzNf\" href=\"/services/pf-return\"><h3>PF &amp; ESIC Return</h3><p>Easy Monthly Filing</p></a><a class=\"premium-card page_serviceItem__VFzNf\" href=\"/services/msme-registration\"><h3>MSME / Udyam</h3><p>Govt Benefits &amp; Subsidies</p></a></div></section><section class=\"page_section__61PEw\"><div class=\"page_whyUs__uMPhZ\"><div class=\"page_whyUsText__WUz_m\"><h2 class=\"page_sectionTitle__hzsAh\" style=\"text-align:left\">Why Smart Founders Choose NetProfit</h2><p class=\"page_whyUsSubtitle__ZrDlM\">Big tech portals treat you like a ticket number. We treat you like a partner. Get 100% human-led legal compliance.</p><ul class=\"page_benefitsList__IZ1k5\"><li><strong>✔️ Dedicated Expert on WhatsApp</strong><p>No automated replies. Directly message your CA/Expert anytime for instant updates.</p></li><li><strong>✔️ Zero-Penalty Guarantee</strong><p>We take full responsibility for your filing. Our human audit ensures 100% accuracy or we pay the fine.</p></li><li><strong>✔️ 100% Transparent Pricing</strong><p>No &quot;starting from&quot; traps. One fixed fee for the entire process, including Govt. charges.</p></li></ul></div><div><div class=\"page_imagePlaceholder__RU3Kh\"><div class=\"page_stats__L5b4y\"><h3>12,000+</h3><p>Happy Founders</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"layout_footer__lSNf_\"><div class=\"layout_footerGrid__9Wh6U\"><div class=\"layout_footerCol__I5QLX\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:1rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:#f97316\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"layout_footerTitle__sTDbQ\" style=\"margin:0\">NetProfit</h3></div><p>One Platform for All Your Tax, Legal &amp; Busines